## ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1.0.5: the flare, its learning, the silence, its pages, signs, inside, borrowed eyes, returns
observer.ui.learned=§7It has learned something about you.
observer.ui.lessons_learned=It has learned how I get away:
observer.learn.light=It puts the lights out before it comes, and it takes brighter light, held longer, to drive it off.
observer.learn.water=It waits at the water's edge now. Climb out too soon and it comes on.
observer.learn.gaze=It comes from behind me now, and a stare has to be held longer.
observer.learn.lens=The first look through the lens only makes it flinch. The second still works.
observer.learn.hit=The first blow does nothing now. The second still makes it flinch.
observer.learn.outrun=It follows much further before it gives up.
observer.learn.veil=It seals the way back twice over.
observer.learn.flare=The first flare only makes it flinch back. The second still works.

