observer.its.deaths.1=You died %s times. I watched every one.
observer.its.deaths.2=%s. You always come back. So do I.
observer.its.home.1=You always come back to %s, %s. Always the same way.
observer.its.home.2=%s, %s. I know where you live.
observer.its.lens.1=You hold the lens like it will save you.
observer.its.lens.2=The lens shows you where I walked. It doesn't show you where I'm standing.
observer.its.name.1=I know your name now, %s.
observer.its.name.2=%s. %s. %s.
observer.its.learn_light.1=You always run for the light. I'll put it out first.
observer.its.learn_light.2=You always run for the light. Not anymore.
observer.its.learn_water.1=You run for the water. I can wait at the edge.
observer.its.learn_water.2=The water won't keep you. I'll be on the shore.
observer.its.learn_gaze.1=You stare until I go. I'll come from behind.
observer.its.learn_gaze.2=Stare. I can stand it longer than you can.
observer.its.learn_lens.1=The lens stings. Only the first time.
observer.its.learn_lens.2=Look through it again. See what happens.
observer.its.learn_hit.1=You hit me. I let you, the first time.
