observer.disc.it_was_inside.title=It Was Inside
observer.disc.it_was_inside.text=I came home and it was already there, standing in the dark corner of the room, eyes glowing. It did not come for me. It waited for me to see it.
observer.disc.it_was_inside.lesson=It hides in dark rooms, even mine. Light the room and it is gone.

